        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a moment of stillness.<br>This is not a challenge, nor a story — only a fleeting meditation. For a few minutes, you sit at the edge of quiet places, dipping your feet into the water. The ripples spread, light shimmers, and soft  sounds drift around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no goal to reach, no score to chase — just the simple rhythm of water and breath.<br>A pause, a fragment of calm, waiting to be revisited whenever you need it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle 5-minute experience of visual and sound meditation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different ambient locations, each with its own quiet mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing ASMR soundscape for headphones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A space to step away, unwind, and breathe.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a moment of stillness.<br>This is not a challenge, nor a story — only a fleeting meditation. For a few minutes, you sit at the edge of quiet places, dipping your feet into the water. The ripples spread, light shimmers, and soft  sounds drift around you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no goal to reach, no score to chase — just the simple rhythm of water and breath.<br>A pause, a fragment of calm, waiting to be revisited whenever you need it.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gentle 5-minute experience of visual and sound meditation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different ambient locations, each with its own quiet mood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing ASMR soundscape for headphones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A space to step away, unwind, and breathe.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "A short meditative journey of feet gently stirring the water, surrounded by shifting landscapes and soothing sounds.",
